You add a term to an existing custom blocklist for an Azure OpenAI resource by using the Azure Resource Manager REST API. The term must be matched as a regular expression. Complete the request.

PUT https://management.azure.com/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/Microsoft.CognitiveServices/accounts/{accountName}/[B1]/{blocklistName}/raiBlocklistItems/{itemName}?api-version=2024-10-01

{
  "properties": {
    [B2]: "proj(ect)?[- ]?falcon",
    [B3]: true
  }
}
